---
interface Props {
  kind: "authoring-loop" | "semantic-substrate";
}

const { kind } = Astro.props;
const titleId = `data-model-figure-${kind}`;
const svgTitleId = `${titleId}-svg-title`;
const svgDescId = `${titleId}-svg-desc`;
---

{
  kind === "authoring-loop" && (
    <figure class="control-figure" aria-labelledby={titleId}>
      <header class="control-figure__header">
        <p>Figure 01 / Authoring loop</p>
        <h3 id={titleId}>One repository, three independent query paths</h3>
      </header>

      <svg
        class="control-figure__svg"
        viewBox="0 0 1100 570"
        role="img"
        aria-labelledby={`${svgTitleId} ${svgDescId}`}
      >
        <title id={svgTitleId}>The cloud agent authoring and verification loop</title>
        <desc id={svgDescId}>
          An Amp Orb edits dbt models, Omni semantic files, dashboard
          specifications, and the metric decision ledger in one repository.
          dbt builds in MotherDuck. The same measures are queried directly in
          MotherDuck, through Omni SQL, and through an Omni topic. The browser
          then builds and checks the dashboard. A pull request returns the code,
          test evidence, parity table, and screenshots to a human reviewer.
        </desc>

        <rect class="svg-lane" x="16" y="16" width="360" height="500" rx="12" />
        <text class="svg-eyebrow" x="40" y="50">ONE MONOREPO</text>

        <rect class="svg-box svg-box--accent" x="40" y="76" width="312" height="78" rx="9" />
        <text class="svg-label" x="62" y="108">Amp Orb</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="62" y="132">fresh machine · branch · browser</text>

        <path class="svg-link svg-link--accent" d="M196 154 V196" />
        <path class="svg-arrow" d="M-6 -8 L0 0 L6 -8" transform="translate(196 196)" />

        <rect class="svg-box svg-box--durable" x="40" y="204" width="312" height="246" rx="9" />
        <rect class="svg-durable-inner" x="46" y="210" width="300" height="234" rx="6" />
        <text class="svg-label" x="64" y="240">Reviewable change</text>
        <text class="svg-code" x="64" y="278">dbt/</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="132" y="278">models · tests · docs</text>
        <text class="svg-code" x="64" y="318">omni/</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="132" y="318">views · topics · measures</text>
        <text class="svg-code" x="64" y="358">context/</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="154" y="358">decision ledger · style guide</text>
        <text class="svg-code" x="64" y="398">evidence/</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="164" y="398">red/green · parity · captures</text>

        <path class="svg-link" d="M352 278 H394 V132 H438" />
        <path class="svg-link" d="M352 318 H410 V282 H438" />
        <path class="svg-link" d="M410 318 V432 H438" />
        <path class="svg-link svg-link--accent" d="M352 358 H386 V520 H918 V488" />
        <path class="svg-link svg-link--accent" d="M352 398 H386" />
        <text class="svg-eyebrow" x="652" y="545" text-anchor="middle">context and evidence travel with the review</text>

        <text class="svg-eyebrow" x="450" y="50">THREE LEGS</text>

        <rect class="svg-box" x="438" y="76" width="260" height="112" rx="9" />
        <text class="svg-index" x="462" y="108">A</text>
        <text class="svg-label" x="500" y="108">MotherDuck</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="462" y="138">dbt build, then direct SQL</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="462" y="160">warehouse grain and counts</text>

        <rect class="svg-box" x="438" y="226" width="260" height="112" rx="9" />
        <text class="svg-index" x="462" y="258">B</text>
        <text class="svg-label" x="500" y="258">Omni SQL</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="462" y="288">same warehouse, new path</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="462" y="310">connection and schema check</text>

        <rect class="svg-box" x="438" y="376" width="260" height="112" rx="9" />
        <text class="svg-index" x="462" y="408">C</text>
        <text class="svg-label" x="500" y="408">Omni topic</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="462" y="438">semantic fields through Explore</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="462" y="460">browser-created dashboard tiles</text>

        <path class="svg-bracket" d="M730 76 H752 V488 H730" />
        <text class="svg-eyebrow" x="776" y="244">PARITY</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="776" y="270">grain · counts</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="776" y="292">canaries · time</text>

        <path class="svg-link svg-link--accent" d="M836 312 V354" />
        <path class="svg-arrow" d="M-6 -8 L0 0 L6 -8" transform="translate(836 354)" />

        <rect class="svg-box svg-box--durable" x="776" y="362" width="286" height="126" rx="9" />
        <rect class="svg-durable-inner" x="782" y="368" width="274" height="114" rx="6" />
        <text class="svg-label" x="800" y="398">Human review</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="800" y="428">code · definitions · evidence</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="800" y="450">merge and publish authority</text>
        <g class="svg-lock" transform="translate(1024 402)">
          <path d="M-5 -4 v-4 a5 5 0 0 1 10 0 v4" />
          <rect x="-9" y="-4" width="18" height="14" rx="2" />
        </g>
      </svg>

      <ul class="control-figure__fallback" aria-label="Figure summary">
        <li>The Orb changes dbt, Omni, context, and evidence files in one branch.</li>
        <li>Leg A queries the dbt build directly in MotherDuck.</li>
        <li>Leg B runs equivalent SQL through Omni.</li>
        <li>Leg C rebuilds the counts through semantic fields in an Omni topic.</li>
        <li>The pull request returns all three legs and the browser evidence for human review.</li>
      </ul>

      <figcaption>
        A green dbt build covers the first path. The browser leg checks
        that the semantic fields survived the trip into the dashboard a person
        will read.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  )
}

{
  kind === "semantic-substrate" && (
    <figure class="control-figure" aria-labelledby={titleId}>
      <header class="control-figure__header">
        <p>Figure 02 / Control substrate</p>
        <h3 id={titleId}>The semantic layer serves every analytical reader</h3>
      </header>

      <svg
        class="control-figure__svg"
        viewBox="0 0 1100 570"
        role="img"
        aria-labelledby={`${svgTitleId} ${svgDescId}`}
      >
        <title id={svgTitleId}>Omni as the shared semantic control substrate</title>
        <desc id={svgDescId}>
          dbt relations and a human-owned metric decision ledger feed the Omni
          semantic model. That model governs dashboards, human exploration,
          Omni's native agents, and external agents using MCP. Branch review,
          content validation, evaluations, and permissions surround the model.
        </desc>

        <text class="svg-eyebrow" x="36" y="48">AUTHORITATIVE INPUTS</text>
        <rect class="svg-box" x="36" y="76" width="252" height="94" rx="9" />
        <text class="svg-label" x="60" y="104">dbt relations</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="60" y="130">grain · joins</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="60" y="151">tested columns</text>

        <rect class="svg-box svg-box--durable" x="36" y="214" width="252" height="118" rx="9" />
        <rect class="svg-durable-inner" x="42" y="220" width="240" height="106" rx="6" />
        <text class="svg-label" x="60" y="250">Metric ledger</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="60" y="276">approved · unresolved</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="60" y="297">refused</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="60" y="318">human-owned definitions</text>

        <path class="svg-link svg-link--accent" d="M288 123 H408 V232" />
        <path class="svg-link svg-link--accent" d="M288 273 H408" />

        <rect class="svg-substrate" x="408" y="146" width="304" height="254" rx="18" />
        <text class="svg-eyebrow svg-eyebrow--inverse" x="438" y="184">OMNI SEMANTIC LAYER</text>
        <text class="svg-label svg-label--inverse" x="438" y="226">Shared meaning</text>
        <text class="svg-small svg-small--inverse" x="438" y="258">dimensions · measures · joins</text>
        <text class="svg-small svg-small--inverse" x="438" y="286">descriptions · permissions</text>
        <path class="svg-rule" d="M438 316 H682" />
        <text class="svg-small svg-small--inverse" x="438" y="344">branch review · validation</text>
        <text class="svg-small svg-small--inverse" x="438" y="368">evals</text>
        <g class="svg-lock svg-lock--inverse" transform="translate(666 220)">
          <path d="M-6 -4 v-5 a6 6 0 0 1 12 0 v5" />
          <rect x="-10" y="-4" width="20" height="16" rx="2" />
        </g>

        <path class="svg-link" d="M712 196 H752 V116 H792" />
        <path class="svg-link" d="M712 252 H760 V220 H792" />
        <path class="svg-link" d="M712 308 H760 V324 H792" />
        <path class="svg-link" d="M712 364 H752 V428 H792" />

        <text class="svg-eyebrow" x="792" y="48">READERS</text>
        <rect class="svg-box" x="792" y="76" width="272" height="80" rx="9" />
        <text class="svg-label" x="816" y="108">Dashboards</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="816" y="132">published analytical content</text>

        <rect class="svg-box" x="792" y="180" width="272" height="80" rx="9" />
        <text class="svg-label" x="816" y="212">Human exploration</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="816" y="236">workbooks · SQL · topics</text>

        <rect class="svg-box" x="792" y="284" width="272" height="80" rx="9" />
        <text class="svg-label" x="816" y="316">Omni agents</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="816" y="340">modeled context and skills</text>

        <rect class="svg-box" x="792" y="388" width="272" height="80" rx="9" />
        <text class="svg-label" x="816" y="420">External agents</text>
        <text class="svg-small" x="816" y="444">MCP with user permissions</text>

        <rect class="svg-review" x="408" y="446" width="304" height="82" rx="41" />
        <text class="svg-small svg-small--center" x="560" y="480">The reviewer authorizes meaning</text>
        <text class="svg-small svg-small--center" x="560" y="504">once, at the shared layer</text>
      </svg>

      <ul class="control-figure__fallback" aria-label="Figure summary">
        <li>dbt contributes tested relations and explicit grains.</li>
        <li>The human-owned ledger contributes the status of each metric definition.</li>
        <li>Omni binds those inputs into dimensions, measures, joins, descriptions, and permissions.</li>
        <li>Dashboards, human exploration, native Omni agents, and external MCP agents read the same layer.</li>
        <li>Branch review, content validation, and evaluations protect changes before publication.</li>
      </ul>

      <figcaption>
        One reviewed definition reaches dashboards, human exploration, Omni's
        agents, and external agents over MCP.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  )
}

<style>
  .control-figure {
    --figure-rule: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 22%, transparent);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 68rem;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: clamp(var(--space-xl), 7vw, var(--space-3xl)) auto;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .control-figure__header {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
    padding-block-end: var(--space-s);
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--figure-rule);
  }

  .control-figure__header p,
  .control-figure__header h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .control-figure__header p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .control-figure__header h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
  }

  .control-figure__svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    margin-block-start: var(--space-m);
  }

  .control-figure__svg :global(path),
  .control-figure__svg :global(rect) {
    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
  }

  .svg-box {
    fill: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.25;
  }

  .svg-box--accent {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 9%, var(--color-bg));
    stroke: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .svg-box--durable {
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .svg-durable-inner {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .svg-lane {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 4%, transparent);
  }

  .svg-substrate {
    fill: var(--color-accent);
    stroke: var(--color-accent);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .svg-review {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 8%, var(--color-bg));
    stroke: var(--color-accent);
    stroke-width: 1.25;
  }

  .svg-link,
  .svg-bracket,
  .svg-rule {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .svg-link--accent,
  .svg-bracket {
    stroke: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .svg-rule {
    stroke: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 70%, transparent);
  }

  .svg-arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-accent);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .svg-lock {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-accent);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .svg-lock--inverse {
    stroke: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .svg-label {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .svg-small,
  .svg-eyebrow,
  .svg-code,
  .svg-index {
    fill: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .svg-eyebrow {
    fill: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .svg-code,
  .svg-index {
    fill: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .svg-index {
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .svg-label--inverse,
  .svg-small--inverse,
  .svg-eyebrow--inverse {
    fill: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .svg-small--center {
    text-anchor: middle;
  }

  .control-figure figcaption {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-s);
    margin-inline: auto;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .control-figure__fallback {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    margin: -1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .control-figure__fallback {
      position: static;
      display: grid;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      margin: var(--space-m) 0 0;
      padding-inline-start: 1.25rem;
      overflow: visible;
      clip: auto;
      gap: var(--space-xs);
      white-space: normal;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: var(--step--1);
    }
  }
</style>
